arred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/react-native-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/react-native-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/react-native-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/react-native-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/react-native-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-06-19T18:55:04Z","label":{"name":"Component: ActivityIndicator","color":"fef2c0"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/503690653","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react-native/issues/25319#issuecomment-503690653","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/25319","id":503690653,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUwMzY5MDY1Mw==","user":{"login":"mrozbarry","id":566486,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NjQ4Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/566486?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry","html_url":"https://github.com/mrozbarry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-06-19T19:09:00Z","updated_at":"2019-06-19T19:09:00Z","body":"Could only reproduce on iOS, Android appears to be fine.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/503690653/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mrozbarry","id":566486,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NjQ4Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/566486?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry","html_url":"https://github.com/mrozbarry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrozbarry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/515542593","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react-native/issues/25319#issuecomment-515542593","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/25319","id":515542593,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUxNTU0MjU5Mw==","user":{"login":"JLWalsh","id":11323156,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzMTU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh","html_url":"https://github.com/JLWalsh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-07-26T17:49:36Z","updated_at":"2019-07-26T20:38:44Z","body":"A temporary workaround would to be extract the `testID` prop and instead assign it to the `View` that wraps the `PlatformActivityIndicator` in [ActivityIndicator.js](https://github.com/facebook/react-native/blob/97d439e0baee3cba2b2e0841bbb8f8db88965fb1/Libraries/Components/ActivityIndicator/ActivityIndicator.js#L102). However, I don't think that this behaviour is wanted, because from what I've read [here](https://developers.perfectomobile.com/display/TT/React-Native+and+unique+identifiers), is seems that `testID` is also assigned on native views on IOS. While the `testID` would still show up when inspecting the native components, it might break some tests for future versions. It also may be a bit of a hack, because the real bug is likely lying in native code.\r\n\r\n[Line 71](https://github.com/facebook/react-native/blob/97d439e0baee3cba2b2e0841bbb8f8db88965fb1/Libraries/Components/ActivityIndicator/ActivityIndicator.js#L71):\r\n```diff\r\n-    const {onLayout, style, size, ...restProps} = props;\r\n+    const {onLayout, style, size, testID, ...restProps} = props;\r\n```\r\n\r\n[Line 101](https://github.com/facebook/react-native/blob/97d439e0baee3cba2b2e0841bbb8f8db88965fb1/Libraries/Components/ActivityIndicator/ActivityIndicator.js#L101):\r\n```diff\r\nreturn (\r\n    <View\r\n+     testID={testID}   \r\n      onLayout={onLayout}\r\n      style={StyleSheet.compose(\r\n        styles.container,\r\n        style,\r\n      )}>\r\n      {Platform.OS === 'android' ? (\r\n        // $FlowFixMe Flow doesn't know when this is the android component\r\n        <PlatformActivityIndicator {...nativeProps} {...androidProps} />\r\n      ) : (\r\n        <PlatformActivityIndicator {...nativeProps} />\r\n      )}\r\n    </View>\r\n  );\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/515542593/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"JLWalsh","id":11323156,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzMTU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh","html_url":"https://github.com/JLWalsh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JLWalsh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/515712104","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react-native/issues/25319#issuecomment-515712104","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/25319","id":515712104,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUxNTcxMjEwNA==","user":{"login":"cabelitos","id":984610,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDYx